<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 580.39, up 1.14.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 270 to 258.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,741,590, compared with 23,552,570 Thursday.</p>
<p>	   (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
